  "sha256": "4e3427db15bd4ec9d73723c39e2668a0e3abac1fddf0dbb197e90f80bebcace6",
  "layout-verification": {
    "checkedCaptions": 35,
    "allInsideSubtitleBand": true,
    "maxLines": 2,
    "captions": [
      {
        "text": "When you touch an object, each fingertip meets a small part of its surface.",
        "x": 201.265625,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1517.46875,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "That local surface has a direction. A small contact plate can turn to match it.",
        "x": 187.03125,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1545.9375,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The Fresnel series explores how this simple contact-plane",
        "x": 376.65625,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1166.6875,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "tilt can suggest shape, stiffness, weight distribution, and inertia.",
        "x": 309.484375,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1301.03125,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "Here is the original CAD geometry from the World Haptics twenty twenty-five demo design.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "Three moving surfaces meet the thumb, index finger, and middle finger. Grip force provides an input.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "Watch the contact surfaces turn around their own pivots.",
        "x": 379.84375,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1160.3125,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The virtual object beside them shows what that changing touch is meant to represent.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "First, shape. Imagine grasping different parts of a bottle.",
        "x": 384.765625,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1150.46875,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The side is almost straight. Near the shoulder, the local surface leans.",
        "x": 257.609375,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1404.765625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The contact plates change orientation to follow those local directions.",
        "x": 248.609375,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1422.78125,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The fingertip cues can agree with the object you see.",
        "x": 422.1875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1075.609375,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The mechanism does not build the whole bottle. It presents a few carefully chosen contact surfaces.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "Next, squeeze. Grip force drives indentation of the virtual surface.",
        "x": 289.859375,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1340.28125,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "A softer region deforms more for the same input. As its shape changes, the local contact directions change too.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "In the twenty twenty-five deformation study, the index and",
        "x": 357.53125,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1204.9375,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "middle contact planes moved while the thumb plane stayed fixed.",
        "x": 288.734375,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1342.515625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The study found better agreement between what people saw and felt.",
        "x": 247.375,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1425.234375,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The change in softness ratings was a trend, not a statistically clear result.",
        "x": 220.609375,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1478.765625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "Now tilt the bottle. The red dot marks its virtual center of gravity.",
        "x": 294.40625,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1331.171875,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "When the mass is offset from the grasp, gravity creates a turning effect that changes with the bottle's angle.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "The proposed rendering model changes the fingertip-plane cue accordingly.",
        "x": 182.625,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1554.734375,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "This suggests a different weight distribution, without moving real ballast inside the mechanism.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "Finally, move the bottle back and forth. Then move it up and down.",
        "x": 273.921875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1372.140625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The cue changes with acceleration: how the motion speeds up, slows down, or reverses.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "The published model treats horizontal and vertical motion separately,",
        "x": 251.671875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1416.65625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "using coordinated fingertip-plane tilt to suggest inertial effects.",
        "x": 309.78125,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1300.421875,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The arrows and moving surfaces here explain that relationship.",
        "x": 319.96875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1280.0625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "They are illustrative commands, not a recording of measured forces or motion.",
        "x": 159.546875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1600.90625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "Across the Fresnel series, the contact principle stays the same. The input and the rendering rule change.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "Grasp for shape. Squeeze for stiffness. Tilt for weight distribution. Shake for inertia.",
        "x": 111.265625,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1697.46875,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The virtual object, the finger contact, and the mechanical movement should tell the same story.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "This film draws on the original Fresnel research and the twenty twenty-five bottle demonstration.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "One CAD model illustrates the series here. Earlier prototypes and experiments differ.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "The transcript links the primary sources and explains the limits.",
        "x": 317.515625,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1284.96875,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      }
    ]
  },
